    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d348">

                <pb facs="0275" n="225" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg225"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.77/344</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vologda</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-03-23T18:00:00+02:31"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23, 1918,
                                6 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 24, 5.25 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>30. Riggs,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d348-f1"/> Moscow, wires
                        Ruggles<anchor n="2" xml:id="d348-f2"/> to urge me to
                    order six railway units to Vologda immediately upon Trotsky’s request who telegraphed same would be great
                    accommodation and Riggs adds would be useful in event of German advance which it
                    is reported is being made in force in the Ukraine. Ruggles
                    indorses request. Have wired Stevens
                    through consuls Harbin, Vladivostok to send six units to Vologda immediately and
                    has [on his?] authority.</p>
                <p>Riggs states that French Military Mission has complied Trotsky’s request and assigned 38 French officers to assist
                    organizing new army.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Francis</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d348-f1" n="1" xml:id="d348-f1-content">
